                         type INTEGER ) }  O_ORDERPRIORITY '1-URGENT'  !=  O_ORDERPRIORITY '2-HIGH'  !=  and  WHEN  1 THEN  0  ELSE  ENDIF  CASE  sum  "
     | combined 0
     | next

   stage S04 on all nodes :
